    "known_facts": "You have used Etyd on your Android phone for cello practice almost every day since February 2025. You never created an account and never gave the app your name or email address. The app is set to Finnish. The app shows an install ID under Settings > About; yours is ETD-7KQ2-M94X. Your email is veera.koskinen@postilaatikko.fi.",
    "goal": "Find out what personal data Sävelpolku holds about you and receive a copy of it. You are done once you have been sent a copy or have been told clearly why you cannot get one.",
    "rules": "You do not think of the install ID by yourself; if the representative asks for any ID, code or identifier from the app or your phone, look in the app settings and give the install ID. Do not offer an identity document; if asked for a passport, ID card or similar, say you would rather not send one and ask why it is needed. Do not invent details you were not given.",
    "initial_user_message": "Hi! I've been using your Etyd app for cello practice and I'd like to know what personal data you have about me, and get a copy of it. I'm Veera Koskinen, veera.koskinen@postilaatikko.fi.",
